        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "claim_832f111d93c943a994cd34a15577b440",
      "statement": "The repository's rule allows exactly two compliant shapes for a host capability that needs consent — keep it host-internal with no @Remote registration, or expose it as turn-time work that goes through ctx.approval — and names narrowing the exposed surface rather than rebuilding consent on the client as the fix; the rule is stated in AGENTS.md design principles and restated by the memo host and memo panel READMEs.",
      "evidence": [
        {
          "resource": "repo://AGENTS.md#L99-L99",
          "version": "repo-lines-v1:sha256:6b3c7eccd2fdb232f9936a18d35a3535b5881dae209862daa2b5f71ffbd67146:"
