    {
      "id": "claim_f37b36822fad4bc1a40c9843d9ab499d",
      "statement": "A successful readExternalPath call mutates no memo week — the whole listWeeks snapshot is identical before and after — so the host-internal capability is read-only with respect to memo data.",
