    {
      "id": "claim_88cfd9991fb34559a340f86948b85fec",
      "statement": "readExternalPath classifies failures by cause into path-not-found, path-not-text, path-too-large, approval-denied, fs-error and fs-unavailable, where approval-denied names a filesystem permission or sandbox refusal (FS_PERMISSION_DENIED, FS_SANDBOX_DENIED, EACCES, EPERM) rather than an approval decision, and the same business code is returned to the caller and recorded in telemetry.",
